291	     * fixed region-to-timezone table (NSW-&gt;Australia/Sydney, VIC-&gt;Australia/Melbourne,
292	     * QLD-&gt;Australia/Brisbane). Returns null when the locality is not in the table so owners with
293	     * an unknown region serialize cleanly.
294	     */
